# Razor View Rules

- Use strongly-typed views: `@model XxxViewModel`
- Helpers: `@Html.LabelFor`, `@Html.TextBoxFor`, `@Html.ValidationMessageFor`
- Layout: `Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml`
- Partials prefix `_`: `_TaskCard.cshtml`

## Forms
```cshtml
@using (Html.BeginForm("Create", "Task", FormMethod.Post))
{
    @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
    @Html.ValidationSummary(true)
    <!-- fields -->
}
```

## Client validation
- Enable unobtrusive validation in layout
- Mirror server Data Annotations on ViewModels

## UI
- Bootstrap 5 classes for layout
- Vietnamese labels OK; keep code identifiers in English
